---
name: Courier report Excel column mapping
description: Real courier report column names and how they map to docket/weight/mode/zone fields
type: feature
---
Uploaded courier reports use these source columns (no literal docket/zone headers):
- documentNo -> docket_number (the real AWB; NOT shipmentType which is DOX/NON-DOX)
- travelBy -> mode (Surface/Air/Express)
- totalWeight -> weight in kg (raw weight column is grams; prefer totalWeight)
- receiverCity -> destination
- No zone column exists. Zone is optional in rate matching; rates fall back to mode+weight match.
Parser detection in src/lib/excel.ts uses ordered candidate patterns to avoid greedy mismatches.
